// Type overrides for swag (swaggo) schema generation.
// swag only parses types declared in this module; it can't resolve types
// declared in external deps (jackc/pgx's pgtype package) without
// --parseDependency, which recurses too deep to be usable here. Instead,
// map each pgtype.* type used in sqlc-generated models to the primitive
// it actually marshals to in JSON responses.
replace pgtype.Numeric number
replace pgtype.Text string
replace pgtype.Timestamp string
replace pgtype.Timestamptz string
replace pgtype.Date string
replace pgtype.Bool boolean
replace pgtype.Int4 integer
replace pgtype.Int8 integer
replace pgtype.Float8 number
replace pgtype.UUID string
replace json.RawMessage object
